msgid "noVehicles/text/vehicleAvailableForBuy"
msgstr ""
"To participate in Onslaught Light, you need to have at least one Tier %(levels)s vehicle in the Garage that is suitable for the mode.\n"
"You can purchase Premium Tier %(levels)s vehicles in the Tech Tree or the in-game Store."

msgid "noVehicles/text/vehicleAvailableForRestore"
msgstr ""
"To participate in Onslaught Light, you need to have at least one Tier %(levels)s vehicle in the Garage that is suitable for the mode.\n"
"You have a Tier %(levels)s vehicle available for recovery."

